                <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, color: '#8B97A8' }}>标识：乌毡帽 + 水纹披风</Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ width: 184, flexDirection: 'column', background: '#FFFFFF', borderRadius: 10, overflow: 'hidden', boxShadow: '0 4px 16px rgba(30,79,168,0.10)' }}>
            <Box style={{ width: 184, height: 244, background: '#E8EFF8' }}>
                <Image src='assets/char_achun.jpg' style={{ width: 184, height: 244, objectFit: 'cover' }} />
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 5, padding: 12 }}>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 8 }}>
                    <Box style={{ width: 10, height: 10, background: '#C8892B', borderRadius: 5 }} />
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 21, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>阿醇</Text>
                </Box>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#1E4FA8', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>绍兴黄酒（国家级非遗）</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.35 }}>憨厚 · 豪爽 · 热心肠</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, color: '#8B97A8' }}>标识：抱酒坛 + 微醺红晕</Text>
