    <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', top: 600, left: 40, width: 1200, height: 56, background: '#E8EFF8', borderRadius: 8, paddingLeft: 22, paddingRight: 22, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 16 }}>
        <FAIcon name='check-circle' style={{ fill: '#1E4FA8', width: 26, height: 26 }} />
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#1A2230' }}>六位角色<b>逐个绑定柯桥真实地标与非遗</b>——鉴湖 / 黄酒 / 仁昌酱园 / 蓝印花布 / 王星记扇 / 鲁镇社戏，满足「深度融合柯桥非遗与文脉内核」要求。</Text>
